OL,3,GNEWSAGTA 6 release a 'write-off' for
OL,4,Ashops, says trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owner of an independent game shop
OL,7,Fhas said the release of Grand Theft
OL,8,FAuto 6 has been a "write-off" for his
OL,9,Fbusiness after he only sold five
OL,10,Fcopies.
OL,12,FRichard Tewksbury, who runs Super Game
OL,13,FShack in the Silver Arcade in
OL,14,FLeicester, said he had seen
OL,15,F"embarrassing" sales of the game
OL,16,Fbecause it was only released as a
OL,17,Fdigital download and not on disc.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
