OL,3,GNEWSAGTA 6 release a 'write-off' for
OL,4,Ashops, says trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn June, developer Rockstar Games said
OL,7,Fphysical copies would contain a code
OL,8,Ffor a digital download rather than the
OL,9,Fmore traditional format. The company
OL,10,Fhas been contacted for comment.
OL,12,FTewksbury said, while he thinks the
OL,13,Fgame is "amazing", the choice to not
OL,14,Fsell physical copies with discs was
OL,15,F"not great" for smaller stores.
